{%- comment -%}
  LUMORA PDP SKIN  ·  lu-pdp-skin.liquid  ·  v1.1 (ported from mockup/product-long-light-serum.html + css/pdp.css)
  Paste into: EVERY product template > Add section > Custom Liquid (padding 0), placed FIRST, above
  "Product information". Holds the icon sprite every PDP snippet uses (#lu-i-*, #lu-m1 to #lu-m6), the
  buy-box layout (eyebrow + rating row, title + price row, pills, Add to bag, sticky bar), the shared
  styles of the ported PDP sections, and the script that keeps "Add to bag · $54" in step with the size.
  Needs lu-skin on the page (tokens).
{%- endcomment -%}
